# NOTE: this repository's existing history stores text files with CRLF.
# Do not add a global `eol=lf` rule here without a dedicated renormalisation
# commit -- doing so rewrites every tracked file and buries real changes.

# Shell scripts must keep LF endings, or bash fails with a confusing
# "bad interpreter: \r" on Windows-checked-out copies.
*.sh text eol=lf

*.py text
*.md text
*.toml text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.json text

*.svg text
*.npy binary
*.faiss binary
*.tv binary
